    "9:30 am in studio: Phil records and files a forecast reel at the station. You see Rita at the studio. Rita invites Phil on the crew radio to contribute to the evening slot.",
    "1:00 pm in studio: Phil uses the paid ticket and rides the coach all the way to Pittsburgh. Rita says: Phil, rolling the forecast now. Larry, send that band reel over so we can lock the rundown. Rita puts the recorded forecast on air. Phil radios Rita and declined the evening assignment.",
